  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Tax Admin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie Skattef&#xf6;rvalt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the spring 2003, The Albanian Tax Administration requested Swedish support for Institutional Support. Sida has initiated the dialogue with Swedish National Tax Board (RSV) as a partner with comparative advantage for the cooperation. In September 200r the Albanian TAX authority presented detailed information of their needs to RSV at the annual meeting arranged by the Intra European Org of Tax Admin (IOTA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under v&#xe5;ren 2003 efterfr&#xe5;gade den albanska skattemyndigheten svenskt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r institutionellt samarbete. Sida initierade en dialog med RSV som har en komparativ f&#xf6;rdel g&#xe4;llande institutionellt samarbete. RSV och den albanska skattemyndigheten tr&#xe4;ffades p&#xe5; det &#xe5;rliga m&#xe4;tet arrangerat av den &quot;Intra European Org of Tax Admin (IOTA)&quot; d&#xe4;r den albanska myndigheten gav en detaljerad information av behov av st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
  </description>
